cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Collaborative PostGIS infrastructure for CARG geological field mapping"
abstract: >-
  Open-source system for multi-operator geological field surveying within the
  Italian CARG project: PostgreSQL/PostGIS geodatabase with Row-Level Security
  and automated audit trail, QGIS/QField offline data collection, and a
  FastAPI/OpenLayers WebGIS for shared progress monitoring.
authors:
  - family-names: Stori
    given-names: Lorenzo
    affiliation: "DISTAV, University of Genova"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-20
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/geomapping-lab/carg-collaborative-gis"
keywords:
  - geological mapping
  - CARG
  - PostGIS
  - Row-Level Security
  - QField
  - WebGIS
